[Name] aurorae
[Summary] KWin 6 window decoration engine (Aurorae)
[License] GPL-2.0-or-later
[Homepage] https://invent.kde.org/plasma/aurorae
[Description] Themeable window decoration engine for KWin 6. Renders Aurorae
themes that users download from the KDE store via the Window Decorations KCM
('Get New Window Decorations'); the shipped aurorae.knsrc provides the store
provider and installs chosen themes into aurorae/themes. No themes are baked
into the image.